roductivity in New Materials R&D\nL197: \nL198: From literature review to molecular design and automated dry-lab experiments for PFAS capture.\nL199: \nL200: →\nL201: \nL202: 04\nL203: ### MiMo Code: Scaling Coding Agents to Long-Horizon Tasks\nL204: \nL205: The core design of a long-horizon coding agent through three themes: computation, memory, and evolution.\nL206: \nL207: →\nL208: \nL209: 05\nL210: \nL211: ### MiMo-V2.5-Pro-UltraSpeed: Pushing 1T-Parameter Model Generation Speed to 1000 TPS\nL212: \nL213: The UltraSpeed mode breaks 1000 tps through extreme model-system Codesign.\nL214: \nL215: →\nL216: \nL217: 06\nL218: \nL219: ### Full-Pipeline Inference Optimization for MiMo-V2.5 Series\nL220: \nL221: Pushing Hybrid SWA efficiency to the limit.\nL222: \nL223: →\nL224: \nL225: 07\nL226: ### Xiaomi MiMo-V2.5-ASR\nL227: \nL228: State-of-the-art open-source speech recognition.\nL229: \nL230: →\nL231: \nL232: 08\nL233: \nL234: ### Xiaomi MiMo-V2.5-TTS Series\nL235: \nL236: Voice synthesis for the agent era.\nL237: \nL238: →\nL239: \nL240: 09\nL241: \nL242: ### Xiaomi MiMo-V2.5-Pro\nL243: \nL244: A leap in agentic and long horizon coherence.\nL245: \nL246: →\nL247: \nL248: 10\nL249: \nL250: ### Xiaomi MiMo-V2.5\nL251: \nL252: A leap in agency and multimodality.\nL253: \nL254: →\nL255: \nL256: 11\nL257: \nL258: ### Xiaomi MiMo-V2-Pro\nL259: \nL260: Global Top-tier agent capabilities.\nL261: \nL262: →\nL263: \nL264: 12\nL265: \nL266: ### Xiaomi MiMo-V2-Omni\nL267: \nL268: See, hear, act in the agentic era.\nL269: \nL270: →\nL271: \nL272: 13\nL273: ### Xiaomi MiMo-V2-TTS\nL274: \nL275: Give your agent a voice. Give it a soul.\nL276: \nL277: →\nL278: \nL279: 14\nL280: \nL281: ### Xiaomi MiMo-V2-Flash\nL282: \nL283: Blazing speed meets frontier performance\nL284: \nL285: →\nL286: \nL287: 15\nL288: \nL289: ### MiMo Humanities and Social Sciences Capability Assessment\nL290: \nL291: MiMo Humanities and Social Sciences Capability Assessment\nL292: \nL293: →\nL294: \nL295: …